      "content": "This was my first bug bounty submission to the Uber program and one of my first bug bounty submissions overall. Thanks Uber for disclosing this!\n\nThe following python script was used in creating a POC: https://github.com/mpgn/heartbleed-PoC\n\nAnd be sure to check out my blog https://healdb.tech/blog/ or my twitter https://twitter.com/heald_ben\nfor Bug Bounty tips and guides!",
